<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Week 5 Briefing: AI & Agentic Workflows</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: 'Calibri', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; margin: 40px; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.6; }
  h1 { color: #0f172a; border-bottom: 3px solid #2563eb; padding-bottom: 10px; font-size: 24pt; }
  h2 { color: #1e40af; margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16pt; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 4px; }
  .badge-container { margin: 15px 0; background: #f8fafc; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
  .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; margin-right: 15px; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 4px; }
  .info { background: #dbeafe; color: #1e40af; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 16px 0; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 10px 14px; text-align: left; font-size: 11pt; }
  th { background-color: #f1f5f9; color: #0f172a; font-weight: bold; }
  tr:nth-child(even) { background-color: #f8fafc; }
  ul { margin-top: 8px; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .rubric-box { background: #f0fdf4; border-left: 4px solid #16a34a; padding: 12px; margin-top: 15px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>🤖 Week 5 Briefing: AI & Agentic Workflows</h1>

<div class="badge-container">
  <span class="badge info">📅 Duration: 2026-08-29 to 2026-09-04</span>
  <span class="badge info">🏷️ Type: Advanced AI Integration</span>
  <span class="badge info">🌟 Showcase: No</span>
</div>

<h2>🎯 Objective</h2>
<p>Integrate intelligent AI features, prompt context models, automated assistant tools, and natural language query capabilities into the platform.</p>

<h2>👥 Roles & Responsibilities</h2>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 25%;">Role</th>
      <th style="width: 35%;">Primary Responsibility</th>
      <th style="width: 40%;">Key Tasks</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>AI Prompt Engineer</strong></td>
      <td>Context & Prompt System</td>
      <td>Craft system prompts, context injection rules, and fallback logic.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>API Integration Lead</strong></td>
      <td>Model Proxy & Endpoints</td>
      <td>Connect frontend to OpenAI/Gemini APIs securely with streaming responses.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>UI Integration Engineer</strong></td>
      <td>AI Chat / Assistant View</td>
      <td>Build interactive chat widget, typing animations, prompt history.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Safety Specialist</strong></td>
      <td>Moderation & Guardrails</td>
      <td>Implement response filtering, error boundaries, and rate limits.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>📋 Key Deliverables</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Working AI assistant component with contextual platform awareness.</li>
  <li>Secure API proxy handling API keys without client leaks.</li>
  <li>Optimized prompt response latency and friendly error fallbacks.</li>
  <li>User testing feedback log on AI query accuracy.</li>
</ul>

<h2>⭐ Evaluation Focus (Week 5 Rubric)</h2>
<div class="rubric-box">
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Task Ownership (10 pts):</strong> Effective implementation of AI capability.</li>
    <li><strong>Code Quality (10 pts):</strong> Token management, error boundary resilience.</li>
    <li><strong>Demo & Understanding (10 pts):</strong> Explaining prompt design & context handling.</li>
    <li><strong>Autonomy (10 pts):</strong> Resolving API payload or model timeout issues independently.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

</body>
</html>
